!CONTRIBUTING.md
!docs/*.md

# Coverage data (xdist workers leave .coverage.<host>.<pid>.* shards).
# The ratchet BASELINE is committed — it is the coverage floor, not data.
.coverage*
!.coverage_ratchet.json
